    "en": "Rizz here is original self-observation of Showing Interest, Threading a Reply, Offering Playfulness and Checking the Invitation. It measures no charm, attractiveness, mind-reading, social ability, moral worth, popularity or dating success. Frequencies are no L/W/Unspoken tiers and infer no one’s interest in you. Smiles, politeness, silence, reply speed, one agreement to meet or these scores replace no agreement to a particular next step. Having no experience or no wish to meet anyone permits general reading without low Rizz assignment or a requirement to approach strangers, persist, disclose private information or pursue any relationship."
